# Source distribution contents beyond what setuptools adds on its own (the compass package,
# README.md, LICENSE.txt and pyproject.toml): the package test suite with its configuration,
# the examples and the skill (tests/test_examples.py runs them), the sync tools and the release
# metadata, so that `pytest` runs from an unpacked sdist. The figure tests stay out: they test
# figures/, which the distribution does not carry.
include pytest.ini AGENT_GUIDE.md CHANGELOG.md CITATION.cff constraints.txt
recursive-include tests *.py
prune tests/figures
recursive-include tools *.py
graft examples
graft skill
global-exclude __pycache__ *.pyc
